1
00:00:00,372 --> 00:00:04,212
...that I need to run simulations
of structure formation in the early universe.

2
00:00:04,376 --> 00:00:08,086
(Leonard:)Good luck getting time on it. The only
people he lets use it are his friends.

3
00:00:08,255 --> 00:00:10,385
(Sheldon:)Well, then, the solution is simple.

4
00:00:10,549 --> 00:00:12,509
(Sheldon:)I shall befriend him.

5
00:00:12,676 --> 00:00:14,256
(Leonard:)Kripke.

6
00:00:14,594 --> 00:00:16,384
(Kripke:)Yeah?

7
00:00:16,555 --> 00:00:19,765
What would you say to the idea
of you and I becoming friends?

8
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:21,313
(Kripke:)I would say...

9
00:00:21,476 --> 00:00:24,396
...I have no interest
in becoming your friend.

10
00:00:24,855 --> 00:00:28,065
(Raj:)Really?
Oh, that seems rather shortsighted...

11
00:00:28,233 --> 00:00:31,363
(Sheldon:)...coming from someone
who is considered altogether unlikable.

12
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:34,993
(Sheldon:)Take some time to reconsider.

13
00:00:35,157 --> 00:00:36,197
(Kripke:)Yeah, I'll do that.

14
00:00:39,077 --> 00:00:43,037
(Sheldon:)Well, I think we're off to a terrific start.

